OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA chilly but largely sunny
OL,6,Fmorning with an early frost. Becoming
OL,7,Fdull and cloudy from the southeast
OL,8,Fthrough the afternoon with the odd
OL,9,Fspot of light rain possible.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FCloudy through the evening
OL,12,Fwith some patchy light rain possible.
OL,13,FStaying cloudy overnight with further
OL,14,Foutbreaks of light rain and freshening
OL,15,Fsoutheast winds.
OL,16,
OL,17,CTuesday:FLargely cloudy with rain at
OL,18,Ftimes, likely turning heavier and more
OL,19,Fpersistent later. Quite breezy around
OL,20,Fthe coasts. Best chance of any
OL,21,Fbrightness towards the Buchan coast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
