OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,6,FLargely cloudy on Wednesday with
OL,7,Foccasionally heavy rain at times. Dry
OL,8,Fwith sunny spells on Thursday. Chance
OL,9,Fof turning rather wet and windy on
OL,10,FFriday.
